## 1. Purpose

This plan defines how {{org_name}} validates {{tool_name}} ({{vendor}}) for the intended use in {{doc_id_01}}: scope, approach, the tests and their depth, sample sizes, evidence rules, roles, acceptance rules, deviation handling and schedule. Section 5 is a **predetermined change protocol** for models: it defines in advance which future model changes are pre-authorised and the exact test that authorises each of them.

